&lt;h3&gt;Tailoring the Template for Your Organization&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;The template is structured for a mid-market to enterprise buyer evaluating two to five CRM vendors, but it scales down. If you’re a smaller team:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Remove or simplify the security and compliance section if you don’t have formal audit requirements&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Condense the integration requirements to list only the three to five systems that matter most&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;Reduce the scoring matrix weights to reflect your actual priorities (small sales teams often care far more about usability than API architecture)&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;If you’re in a regulated industry (financial services, healthcare, government), expand the security and compliance section and add vendor-specific attestation requirements.&lt;/p&gt; 
