&lt;p&gt;Seventy percent of marketers believe the marketing industry has changed more in the past three years than &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/hubspot-blog-marketing-industry-trends-report"&gt;in the past 50&lt;/a&gt;. That means that marketing automation platforms need to change, too. Pardot is a longtime fixture of the B2B landscape, but the lack of development has left many businesses looking for alternatives.&lt;/p&gt;  
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="cta_button" href="https://www.hubspot.com/cs/ci/?pg=b9960dd8-68b8-4caa-8a08-d3f7b7c3406e&amp;amp;pid=53&amp;amp;ecid=&amp;amp;hseid=&amp;amp;hsic="&gt;&lt;img class="hs-cta-img " style="height: auto !important; width: auto !important; max-width: 100% !important;border-width: 0px; /*hs-extra-styles*/; margin: 0 auto; display: block; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px" alt="Get Started with HubSpot's Marketing Software for Free" height="60" width="502" src="https://no-cache.hubspot.com/cta/default/53/b9960dd8-68b8-4caa-8a08-d3f7b7c3406e.png" align="middle"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Why are businesses leaving? What Pardot alternatives are they choosing, and what do experts say about having a successful migration? This guide answers all these questions and more.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Why Marketers Are Seeking Pardot Alternatives Now&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Pardot (rebranded as Marketing Cloud Account Engagement in 2022) is a B2B marketing automation platform owned by Salesforce. According to Pardot expert &lt;a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thomasmatthewryan/"&gt;Tom Ryan&lt;/a&gt;, founder of &lt;a href="https://marcloudconsulting.com/"&gt;MarCloud&lt;/a&gt;, many Pardot users choose to leave because they fear it will be discontinued.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Ryan has been a Pardot consultant since 2016 and feels the eventual discontinuation is obvious. “There’s no development on the platform,” he explains. “There’s a clear migration path.” To Ryan, it feels like “it’s just a case of ‘when’ not ‘if.‘”&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Beyond discontinuation fears, Ryan points to revenue attribution and reporting as persistent pain points. Revenue attribution is “[incredibly difficult] if you do not know how to do it. Users need to wrestle with the Pardot-Salesforce sync,” he said. Reporting presents similar challenges, as the platform offers little flexibility. “The reports are not customizable in Pardot and therefore, people cannot get the reports they need. Clear reporting in general is very difficult for people to achieve, without consultant-level knowledge.”&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;In Ryan’s experience, the most common destination for customers leaving Pardot is HubSpot. “Pardot to HubSpot makes the most sense. There’s a lot of architectural similarities between Pardot and HubSpot via the connector. So there’s a familiarity there, and you get so much more.”&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;How to Evaluate Pardot Alternatives for B2B Teams&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Pardot alternatives should be evaluated on CRM integration. HubSpot and Zoho both offer full CRM capabilities, making them top candidates for businesses &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/sales/salesforce-alternatives"&gt;leaving Salesforce altogether&lt;/a&gt;. Salesforce Marketing Cloud Next runs natively on Salesforce’s own platform, so there’s no separate system to sync at all, eliminating the data silo issue that Pardot has. Marketo maintains a native two-way Salesforce sync for teams that want to keep their CRM there. ActiveCampaign offers the same native Salesforce sync, plus its own lightweight CRM for teams that want to consolidate instead.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;B2B teams should also weigh these criteria when reviewing Pardot alternatives.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABM and lead scoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Does the platform support both individual lead scoring and coordinated outreach across a group?&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Is the data easy for sales to access?&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrations:&lt;/strong&gt; Does the new platform integrate with your &lt;a href="https://blog.hubspot.com/marketing/how-to-build-a-marketing-stack"&gt;existing marketing tech stack&lt;/a&gt;: email marketing, analytics, reporting tools, etc.?&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time-to-value:&lt;/strong&gt; Can a marketer build and launch without a developer or certified consultant, or does every task require outside help?&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Pardot Alternatives at a Glance&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Pardot Alternatives&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Businesses looking to leave Pardot need to evaluate other tools based on CRM sync, automation capabilities, integrations, and price.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. HubSpot Marketing Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;HubSpot Marketing Automation builds multi-step B2B nurture workflows that trigger based on behavior, lifecycle stage, or CRM data. The tool is designed for marketers who want their data under one roof with &lt;a href="https://www.hubspot.com/products/crm"&gt;HubSpot’s Smart CRM&lt;/a&gt;, alleviating the pain points of Pardot’s siloed design and clunky features. Teams can replace Salesforce CRM with HubSpot CRM, or use the &lt;a href="https://knowledge.hubspot.com/salesforce/install-the-hubspot-salesforce-integration"&gt;native two-way sync&lt;/a&gt; to keep contacts, companies, deals, and activity history aligned across both platforms.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key HubSpot Features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;ul&gt; 
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing automation:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Build multi-step nurture workflows that trigger based on a prospect’s behavior, lifecycle stage, or CRM data. This replaces the rigid workflows in Pardot with something marketers can build and adjust themselves.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://53.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/53/pardot-alternatives-2-20260812-9203620.webp" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; display: block; width: 650px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;" title="" alt="hubspot marketing automation workflow showing if/then branching for post-webinar nurture campaign https://www.hubspot.com/products/marketing/marketing-automation"&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing campaigns:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Connect social, ads, emails, and landing pages into one tracked campaign. This allows B2B teams to measure cross-channel impact without manually piecing data together between sources.&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://53.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/53/pardot-alternatives-3-20260812-1815384.webp" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; display: block; width: 650px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;" title="" alt="hubspot campaigns dashboard displaying roi, campaign spend, and attributed revenue metrics"&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
