&lt;div&gt; 
 &lt;table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; border: 3px none currentcolor;"&gt;
  &lt;colg...

&lt;p&gt;If you’re comparing Scrunch alternatives, start by separating monitoring from execution. Monitoring tools show how brands appear in AI-generated answers. Optimization tools add recommendations, content briefs, or workflows that help teams act on those findings.&lt;/p&gt;  
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="cta_button" href="https://www.hubspot.com/cs/ci/?pg=9dd5e54b-fbef-4dd0-bc44-1689feb1ea18&amp;amp;pid=53&amp;amp;ecid=&amp;amp;hseid=&amp;amp;hsic="&gt;&lt;img class="hs-cta-img " style="height: auto !important; width: auto !important; max-width: 100% !important;border-width: 0px; /*hs-extra-styles*/; margin: 0 auto; display: block; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px" alt="Get Started with HubSpot's AEO Tool" height="58" width="335" src="https://no-cache.hubspot.com/cta/default/53/9dd5e54b-fbef-4dd0-bc44-1689feb1ea18.png" align="middle"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Answer engine optimization (AEO) has become a budget priority. In Conductor’s &lt;a href="https://www.conductor.com/academy/state-of-aeo-geo-report/"&gt;2026 survey of more than 250 enterprise digital leaders&lt;/a&gt;, 94% planned to increase AEO investment.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;This guide compares 13 Scrunch AI competitors by use case, engine coverage, execution features, pricing, seat limits, and customer relationship management (CRM) integration.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
&lt;h2&gt;Why Teams Are Comparing Scrunch Alternatives Now&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;Scrunch is an AI search visibility and agent experience platform. Its Core plan tracks 125 prompts across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, and Microsoft Copilot. Core also includes five monthly site audits, insights and recommendations, one monthly page optimization, basic content generation, and five user licenses. Teams may still compare alternatives for four practical reasons.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entry price:&lt;/strong&gt; Core costs $250 per month, which may exceed the budget for an early AEO pilot.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engine coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Core covers four platforms. Teams that need Gemini, Claude, Google AI Mode, Grok, or Meta AI need Enterprise or another product.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Core includes recommendations and limited optimization support, but teams that need large-scale content creation or automated workflows may need a stronger execution layer.&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Packaging and scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Core limits teams to 125 prompts, one brand workspace, and five users. Enterprise pricing is custom.&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;For teams that want visibility data connected to customer context and marketing workflows, &lt;a href="https://www.hubspot.com/products/aeo"&gt;HubSpot AEO&lt;/a&gt; is a practical first alternative to evaluate.&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;a&gt;&lt;/a&gt; 
